  We note that $H_{\lambda,C^2}(x,y)\to \infty$ as ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:7a40efa6a83790c5f189dcf4041427245432abe98723548ff2fa90191cba6b6b","revision_digest":"sha256:94405741195849e1b81357e899f7f239802f830914d9bc24c2b2aee1d48cb5af","source_id":"arxiv:2609.02073","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

