=\Big\langle \sum_{i\in I} a_i h_i,\ h_j\Big\rangle_{\mathcal A}
=\sum_{i\in I} a_i\,\langle h_i,h_j\rangle_{\mathcal A}
=a_j\,1_{\mathcal","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:a8761ae12f2de07e71e5be8cfc2030df92f7f27ee1e991c79098179b0af747cd","revision_digest":"sha256:b0493ed6ed22176c3ed423e680b594919069d57c48b8865879b6868cb896d45d","source_id":"arxiv:2608.30589","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

