[Lemma 7 (Uniform fourth moments near the zero shift) of arXiv:2608.07820, 'Linear Spectral Statistics for Entrywise-Transformed Spiked Wigner Matrices under Shifted '] Assume \eqref{eq:W5-package}.  There exist \(\delta_0>0\) and
\(C_4<\infty\) such that
\begin{equation}
 \sup_{|s|\le\delta_0}\E|Y_s|^4\le C_4.
\end{equation}
If \eqref{eq:W3-package} also holds, then \(\delta_0\) may be chosen so that
\begin{equation}
 \frac12\le v(s)\le\frac32,
 \qquad |s|\le\delta_0.
