\]
Then
\begin{equation}
V_{mT}^u
 =I+\sum_{n\geq1}\ 
  \sum_{j_1,\ldots,j_n=1}^r
  u_{j_1}\cdots u_{j_n}
  \int_{0<\tau_1<\cdots<\tau_n<mT}
