body:
[Proposition 49 of arXiv:2606.16636, 'Free energy of non-convex multi-species spin glasses with centered Ising spins'] For every $t\geq0$ and every $q=(q_s)_{s\in\sS}\in\mcl Q_2^\sS$, writing $q^\lambda:=\sum_{s\in\sS}\lambda_s q_s$,
we have
\begin{align}

    u(t,q^\lambda)\leq f(t,q)\leq \sum_{s\in\sS}\lambda_s u(t,q_s).
\end{align}
In particular, we have $f(t,0)=u(t,0)$.

