$$
\cD_R (0) = \bigcap_{v \in \Z^d \,:\, \| v \|_\infty \leq d} \big\{ | \chi \cap \Lambda_R (v) | \geq M+1 \big\} \,.
$$
The properties of the Poisson point process $\chi$ allow us to compute
