[Proposition 22 of arXiv:2604.18871, 'Quantitative approximation of the Vlasov(--Fokker--Planck)--Navier--Stokes system by stoch'] Let Assumptions~\ref{assump-PDE} and \ref{assump-particles} hold, with $\sigma > 0$.
Then there exists a constant $C=C(T,k,A,\gamma,d,p)>0$ such that for any $N\in \N^*$,

\begin{align*}
\rate
&\leq C \Big(  \big\| \langle v \rangle^{k} (F_{0}\ast \vartheta^{N}-F_{0})  \big\|_{L^{2}_{x,v}}  + \frac{1}{N^{\beta(\gamma-\frac{d}{p})}} + \frac{1}{N^{\alpha-\beta}} +|\sigma_{N}-\sigma|^\frac{1}{2} \Big).
\end{align*}

