$ on $G_ g$ is a function defined on the edge set $E_ g$ and taking its values in $\mathbb N=\lbrace 0,1,\ldotsbrace$. We let $\Omega_{G_ g}$ be the set of currents on $G_ g$. The set of \emph{sources} of $
