[Prop 17 (Endpoint branch is dominated for $a \ge 1$) of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] Let $a \ge 1$ and $p \in (0, \bar p(a))$. Then
\begin{align*}
    (1-p)\,\nu_{\max}(p,a) < a\left(1 + \log\frac{1}{2p}\right),
    \qquad\text{that is}\qquad
    R(p,a) < a.
\end{align*}

