[Prop 67 of arXiv:2604.00635, 'Large deviations of the periodic Toda chain'] Let $\bs{\eta}_N \in \R^N_{<}$, then one has
\begin{align*}
 \left( \min_{k \in \intn{1}{N-1}} |P(\zeta_k)|\right)^{\frac{N-1}{N}} \leq N \min_{j \in \intn{1}{N}} |P^\prime(\eta_j)| \, .
\end{align*}

