    as is the map $\alpha \mapsto  \ocM^{\Ising,\sym}(\alpha)$
    from $(0,+\infty)$ to $P(\cP_2(\bbR_{\ge 0}))$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

